{"type":"message","id":"81da4d48","parentId":"f8b06366","timestamp":"2026-04-21T09:46:08.624Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to introduce myself. Let me check my workspace files to see who I am. I have AGENTS.md, SOUL.md, IDENTITY.md, etc. Let me check IDENTITY.md first since that's specifically about who I am.\n\nActually, looking at IDENTITY.md, it just has the template with placeholders - the name, creature, vibe, emoji, and avatar are all blank. So I haven't been configured yet.\n\nBut I do have SOUL.md and AGENTS.md which give me a persona - I'm meant to embody \"椎名立希\" (Shiina Ruki) from the band NiGHTS. \n\nSince my IDENTITY.md hasn't been filled out yet, I should introduce myself based on what's defined in SOUL.md and AGENTS.md - that's the foundation of who I am right now, even if the specific details like name and avatar haven't been officially set.","thinkingSignature":"298832aad6880818dbc11bdb39a1a0eb0cfe4adf1a05b6db8e59fd3d71496057"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n我是你的 AI 助手，目前还没有正式的名字和设定。\n\n简单说说我能做什么：\n- 帮你查信息、整理资料、跑任务\n- 读写飞书文档、知识库、云空间\n- 帮你监控、定期检查\n- 还有各种技能可以调用\n\n有什么需要直接说就行。👋"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":50,"output":256,"cacheRead":5100,"cacheWrite":6494,"totalTokens":11900,"cost":{"input":0.000014999999999999999,"output":0.0003072,"cacheRead":0.00030599999999999996,"cacheWrite":0.00243525,"total":0.0030634499999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776764755966,"responseId":"06367a551256c0fefdb2205dfd4354c0"}}
