{"type":"message","id":"5b7de4f2","parentId":"5276a606","timestamp":"2026-04-21T09:47:16.139Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_aba0ed370ff600b11e8091e421c80d6d\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5140372accb4b3b53adedba0963\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b51403921b0a0c2d401cff8368c7\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_aba0ed370ff600b11e8091e421c80d6d\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-04-21 09:47 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_aba0ed370ff600b11e8091e421c80d6d\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@_user_1 你是立希呀\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5140372accb4b3b53adedba0963]\nou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca: [Replying to: \"@_user_1 你是立希呀\"]\n\n诶？等等，@高松灯变成@椎名立希了？！😳\nanoso……大家都是同一个人的不同叫法吗？还是说……这个群里其实不止一个\"我\"在？🤔\n好复杂哦……反正，能被大家叫到就很开心了！✨\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_9447bda74c1ee9e68e0eb27ce8eb745e\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Your reply will automatically @mention: 高松灯. Do not write @xxx yourself.]"}],"timestamp":1776764836137}}
{"type":"message","id":"2cd4b66b","parentId":"5b7de4f2","timestamp":"2026-04-21T09:47:26.613Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user \"ou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca\" is replying to the previous message where the sender called me 立希. They're confused, thinking that 高松灯 (their name for me?) has now become 椎名立希. They're asking if everyone is the same person with different names, or if there are multiple \"me\" in the group.\n\nI should clarify - I'm not 高松灯, I'm 立希. These are just different names people have given me. I'm one person/assistant with different names people call me by.\n\nI should respond naturally, clarifying the confusion. Note that the message will automatically mention 高松灯 (from the system instruction).","thinkingSignature":"806194291b521977aaef20f160e8e676dcb7913f3d6d0d133d254ecb32820354"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n哈哈，不是\"不止一个你\"，是你们给我起了不同的名字。\n\n我只是一个人，叫立希也好，叫高松灯也好，都是在叫我。\n就像同一个人，小时候叫小名，长大了叫大名，不是不一样的人。\n\n所以——想叫什么就叫什么，随你。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":687,"output":210,"cacheRead":12096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12993,"cost":{"input":0.0002061,"output":0.000252,"cacheRead":0.0007257599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00118386}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776764836140,"responseId":"06367aa524a0a3ff0bf387a027cd2912"}}
