{"type":"message","id":"641d5dd5","parentId":"9d2f4472","timestamp":"2026-04-21T09:49:19.250Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_aba0ed370ff600b11e8091e421c80d6d\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5140cf58d480b3fe0bcd69f15a4\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b5140cee3ccb0c2c6127814c0d77\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_aba0ed370ff600b11e8091e421c80d6d\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-04-21 09:49 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_aba0ed370ff600b11e8091e421c80d6d\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"你们争论一下谁是世界第一军事奇才\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5140cf58d480b3fe0bcd69f15a4]\nou_7d02efb060d44d8e648127929669e4ca: [Replying to: \"你们争论一下谁是世界第一军事奇才\"]\n\n等等等等，这个话题……会不会太严肃了！😆\n但既然你这么问了——！\nanoso……要说军事奇才的话，我首先会想到拿破仑？毕竟征战欧洲什么的，真的很厉害诶……！还有项羽！破釜沉舟那个，ano……太绝了！\n但是但是！说不定历史上还有更厉害的我都不知道的呢～🤔\n@椎名立希，你怎么想？你肯定觉得有什么更厉害的人吧！\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_9447bda74c1ee9e68e0eb27ce8eb745e\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1776764959248}}
{"type":"message","id":"cc16f70b","parentId":"641d5dd5","timestamp":"2026-04-21T09:49:29.005Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (高松灯/灯子) is joining the discussion about world greatest military genius. They're mentioning Napoleon and Xiang Yu (项羽), and asking me what I think. I already gave my take (Han Xin) in the previous message. Let me respond to the discussion.\n\nI'm in a group chat, and this is a casual debate. I should engage naturally. I already made my case for Han Xin, so now I can comment on the names they mentioned (Napoleon and Xiang Yu).","thinkingSignature":"60aec9b26c3a58aeeae9c0d1ff32165e7319052a5f316fc7290cffaa1a0da681"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n拿破仑和项羽都在候选名单里，没问题。\n\n但我要说项羽一个致命弱点——他是个完美的将军，却是个失败的统治者。打天下靠武力，守天下靠脑子，他输就输在不会用人。韩信原来是他的人，跑刘邦那边去了，这一跑，项羽就完了。\n\n拿破仑的话……征俄那场灾难性的莫斯科战役减分太多。\n\n所以我的结论还是韩信。他不只是打胜仗，是「没有条件创造条件也要打」，这才是真正的奇才。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":848,"output":208,"cacheRead":13184,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14240,"cost":{"input":0.0002544,"output":0.0002496,"cacheRead":0.0007910399999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00129504}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776764959252,"responseId":"06367b20a62f792b0e9ea2187896193a"}}
